that respondent No.3 in connivance with the complainant and his family has falsely implicated the Sahil Kumar Age 24 Years S/O Sukhdev ... vs Union Territory Of Jammu & Kashmir on 22 May, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/150572072/
